#!/bin/rc
# HF vs lumen parity ladder (Qwen2.5 + GGUF). Run Python on a host with torch/transformers;
# run 6.out on Plan 9 after mk. Merge stderr into stdout file: >file >[2=1] (see rc(1))
#
# Set these or export before sourcing:
#   gguf=Qwen2.5-0.5B-Instruct-f16.gguf
#   hf='Qwen/Qwen2.5-0.5B-Instruct'
#   tok=hello2.tok
#   row=19482
#   pos=1

if(~ $#gguf 0) gguf=Qwen2.5-0.5B-Instruct-f16.gguf
if(~ $#hf 0) hf='Qwen/Qwen2.5-0.5B-Instruct'
if(~ $#tok 0) tok=hello2.tok
if(~ $#row 0) row=19482
if(~ $#pos 0) pos=1

echo '--- 1) embed row: lumen -Z vs hf_hidden_ref --embed-row ---'
echo ' 6.out   '^$gguf^' -Z '^$row^' -n 0 >/tmp/lumen.out >[2=1]; grep lumen_dump /tmp/lumen.out'
echo ' python3 hf_hidden_ref.py -m '^$hf^' --embed-row '^$row^' --dtype float16'
echo
echo '--- 2) hidden fingerprints (-D pos vs hf_hidden_ref --pos): lumen_dbg lines ---'
echo ' 6.out   '^$gguf^' -P '^$tok^' -n 0 -D '^$pos^' >/tmp/lumen.out >[2=1]; grep lumen_dbg /tmp/lumen.out'
echo ' python3 hf_hidden_ref.py -m '^$hf^' -p '^$tok^' --pos '^$pos^' --dtype float16'
echo ' L0: logits_h0, probs_h0 (attn bisect), preatn, attn; last line pre_logits vs final norm.'
echo
echo '--- 3) next-token logits: lumen -F vs hf_logits_ref (end-to-end) ---'
echo ' 6.out   '^$gguf^' -P '^$tok^' -n 1 -F >/tmp/lumen.out >[2=1]; grep lumen_hf /tmp/lumen.out'
echo ' python3 hf_logits_ref.py -m '^$hf^' -p '^$tok^' --dtype float16'
echo
echo '--- 4) moving forward ---'
echo ' Compare pre_logits sumsq/cksum (step 2) first; then greedy_id in lumen_hf (step 3).'
echo ' ~1% drift on L0_logits_h0 F16 GGUF vs HF FP32 is common; fix large greedy gaps, not every cksum.'
echo
echo 'Bisect: embed ok but later wrong — layer -D; L0_preatn vs HF — MHA vs wo; parity.rc step 3 — full graph.'
echo 'GGUF embed_layout from token_embd ne[].'
